..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : PRICEMAINTENANCE.INCREASE
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Does an absolute or relative increase to the basevalue using
.. the specified value of increase. If percentual is true, it will do a relative
.. otherwise an absolute increase.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|basevalue)
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|valueofincrease)
.continue USAGE ? _F|compatible(F|typeof(U|basevalue), "R")
.continue USAGE ? _F|compatible(F|typeof(U|valueofincrease), "R")
..
.continue ABSOLUT ? _F|defined(U|percentual)
.continue USAGE   ? _F|compatible(F|typeof(U|percentual), "B")
.continue ABSOLUT ? _U|percentual
..
.. Do a percentual increase
.formula U|basevalue = U|basevalue * (100 + U|valueofincrease) / 100
.continue END
..
!ABSOLUT: Do an absolute increase
.formula U|basevalue = U|basevalue + U|valueofincrease
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
..
!USAGE
.set trans -
.output terminal
Undefined or wrong typed arguments found!
This program increases specified argument basevalue
using the specified argument valueofincrease.

Both should be defined and be reals.
If argument percentual is defined and set to true,
it will do an percentual increase; otherwise an
absolute.
..
!BREAK
.end 1
